":"Munozodza musoro wangu namafuta;","poem":1},{"text":"mukombe wangu unopfachukira.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"Zvirokwazvo kunaka kwenyu norudo rwenyu zvichanditevera,","poem":1},{"text":"mazuva ose oupenyu hwangu,","poem":2},{"text":"uye ndichagara mumba maJehovha","poem":1},{"text":"nokusingaperi.","poem":2}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/sna_bib/PSA/23.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/sna_bib/PSA/24.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/sna_bib/PSA/22.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":6}